{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a11a1010-4d7e-4b2a-9f11-6e0c1d8a4b10",
    "name": "School API — Admin Dashboard",
    "description": "Platform-admin dashboard counters. **Documented:** `GET /admin/dashboard`.\n\nThis is the last live backend route. Import list is complete. Do not recreate a monolith.\n\n- Requires Bearer `{{accessToken}}` **then** `{{adminHost}}`.\n- `requireAdminSession` runs **before** method and host — missing/invalid token is **401** `{ \"error\": \"Unauthorized\" }` even on a school host.\n- Wrong method after a valid admin token: **405** `{ \"error\": \"Method not allowed\" }` (method is checked **before** host — POST on a school host is 405, not 403).\n- Wrong host after a valid admin GET: **403** `{ \"error\": \"This action is only allowed on the admin host\" }`.\n- Tenant directory stays in `Admin-Tenants.postman_collection.json`. Newest here is a **3-row** summary, not the paged list.\n\nShared environment: `environments/School-API.local.postman_environment.json`.\n\n- `{{baseUrl}}` is the **backend** (`http://127.0.0.1:5000`), not Next on `3000`.\n- Prefer `x-school-host` over `Host`. Matching lowercases and strips `:{port}`.\n- Tokens are HMAC (`payload.signature`), not JWT. Admin `{{accessToken}}` will not verify on school/campus routes (different HMAC material). School and campus share `:school-account-session`.\n- Error JSON (except health): `{ \"error\": \"<string>\" }`. No 422. Wrapper-only 500 is `{ \"error\": \"Internal server error\" }`.\n- Do not invent routes or status codes. All live backend method+path pairs are in the split collections.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:5000"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Admin Dashboard",
      "description": "Derived platform counters on `admin.<rootHost>`. Sign in via **Admin Session** first (`{{accessToken}}`). Host must be `admin.{{rootHost}}` (`{{adminHost}}` = `admin.e-school.et:3000`).\n\nReads `store.readDashboardStats()` and derives `servingPercent` as `Math.round(activeCount / schoolCount * 100)` (0 when there are no schools). `newest` is capped at **3** (createdAt desc, then id desc). Year buckets use the UTC year of `createdAt` as a **string** key.\n\nNo query params. No JSON body. Does not write environment ids — copy a tenant id from **Admin Tenants** if needed.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get admin dashboard",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}",
                "description": "HMAC admin session from POST /admin/session. Missing header, non-Bearer scheme, empty token, expired, school/campus HMAC, or bad signature → 401 Unauthorized. Checked before method and host."
              },
              {
                "key": "x-school-host",
                "value": "{{adminHost}}",
                "description": "Must be admin.<rootHost> after port strip (admin.e-school.et or admin.e-school.et:3000). Checked only after a valid admin token AND GET. School / app / apex / Host fallback → 403."
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "dashboard"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns platform-wide tenant counters for the signed-in operator.\n\n**Auth:** required. `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`. `requireAdminSession` / `readPlatformAdminSession` runs **before** method and host. Missing header, non-`Bearer ` scheme, empty token, expired, or school/campus HMAC → `401 { \"error\": \"Unauthorized\" }` **even when `x-school-host` is a school host**.\n\n**Who:** the signed-in platform operator. School and campus tokens will not verify (different HMAC material).\n\n**Method (after auth):** GET only. POST / PUT / PATCH / DELETE → `405 { \"error\": \"Method not allowed\" }`. Method is checked **before** `rejectIfNotAdminHost`, so a non-GET with a valid admin token on a school host is **405**, not 403.\n\n**Host (required after auth + GET):** `rejectIfNotAdminHost` / `isPlatformAdminHost`. `x-school-host` (else `Host`) must be `admin.{{rootHost}}` after lowercase + port strip. `{{adminHost}}` = `admin.e-school.et:3000` is valid. School / app / apex / `127.0.0.1` → `403 { \"error\": \"This action is only allowed on the admin host\" }` (not the admin-login 403 text).\n\n**Query / body:** none. Extra query strings are ignored. No 400 from this handler.\n\n**Side effects:** none. Reads the `platform.dashboard_stats` row (or the in-memory equivalent). Does not create or mutate tenants.\n\n**Success `200`:** `{ schoolCount, activeCount, pendingSetupCount, suspendedCount, servingPercent, createdByYear, newest }`.\n- Counts are non-negative integers. Empty directory is still 200 with all counts **0**, `servingPercent` **0**, `createdByYear` `{}`, `newest` `[]`.\n- `servingPercent` is derived: `total === 0 ? 0 : Math.round((activeCount / schoolCount) * 100)` (1/3 → **33**, 2/3 → **67**). Not stored on the stats row.\n- `createdByYear` is `Record<string, number>` with UTC year keys (`\"2026\"`, not `2026`).\n- `newest` is at most **3** schools: `{ id, name, slug, email, status, created }`. `status` is `pending_setup` | `active` | `suspended`. `slug` / `email` may be `null` (`pending_setup` typically has `slug: null`). `created` is ISO-8601 from `createdAt`. Order: newest `createdAt` first, then `id` descending.\n- HTTP body does **not** include `ok`, `updatedAt`, `founded`, `username`, `host`, `mustChangePassword`, or mail/sign-in fields. Those belong to `GET /admin/tenants`.\n\n**Errors that exist:** 401 Unauthorized; 403 admin-host only; 405 if not GET (reached only **after** a valid admin token).\n\n**Not used:** 400, 404 (path exists), 409, 422. No distinct 500 from this handler."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.test('dashboard is { schoolCount, activeCount, pendingSetupCount, suspendedCount, servingPercent, createdByYear, newest }', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('schoolCount').that.is.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('activeCount').that.is.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('pendingSetupCount').that.is.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('suspendedCount').that.is.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('servingPercent').that.is.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('createdByYear').that.is.an('object');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.createdByYear).to.not.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('newest').that.is.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.not.have.property('ok');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.not.have.property('updatedAt');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.newest.length).to.be.at.most(3);",
                  "    if (body.schoolCount === 0) {",
                  "      pm.expect(body.servingPercent).to.eql(0);",
                  "    }",
                  "    body.newest.forEach(function (school) {",
                  "      pm.expect(school).to.have.property('id').that.is.a('string');",
                  "      pm.expect(school).to.have.property('name').that.is.a('string');",
                  "      pm.expect(school).to.have.property('slug');",
                  "      pm.expect(school).to.have.property('email');",
                  "      pm.expect(school.status).to.be.oneOf(['pending_setup', 'active', 'suspended']);",
                  "      pm.expect(school.created).to.be.a('string');",
                  "      pm.expect(school).to.not.have.property('founded');",
                  "      pm.expect(school).to.not.have.property('username');",
                  "      pm.expect(school).to.not.have.property('host');",
                  "    });",
                  "  });",
                  "}",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
                  "  pm.test('unauthenticated is 401 with Unauthorized', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.eql('Unauthorized');",
                  "  });",
                  "}",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 403) {",
                  "  pm.test('admin host required', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.eql('This action is only allowed on the admin host');",
                  "  });",
                  "}",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 405) {",
                  "  pm.test('method not allowed', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.eql('Method not allowed');",
                  "  });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
